Cost: Pay-what-you-can</p>
<p>Play, tinker, and create at Fairfields Heritage House. Families are invited to get crafty with drop-in activities inspired by heritage skills and local history. Explore the museum, and discover the story of the Bell family, with a fun, kid-friendly scavenger hunt.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>September 28 - Metal stamp keychains<br>
October 19 - Slime<br>
November 23 - Air dry clay</strong></p>
<h4><strong>Notes:</strong></h4>
